CloudBurrow patch 16 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1273). Applies after patch 0015; needs
googlesqlite patch 0029.

A table made by tables.insert with timePartitioning on a field, or with
rangePartitioning, is made in the engine with the pseudo-column
_PARTITION_BUFFERED BOOL, which marks the rows of its streaming buffer
(googlesqlite patch 0029), and a CREATE TABLE's schema leaves the column
out as it leaves out _PARTITIONTIME.

